<title>UK: Komercni unit sets 300 million mark three-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Komercni unit sets 300 million mark three-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KOMERCNI BANK FINANCE BV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  KOMERCNI BANKA A.S.</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   SPREAD     20 BP     MATURITY    18.OCT.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    18.OCT.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY BAA2	ISS PRICE  =	   FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    99.94</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT	 DENOMS (K) 10	  GOV LAW    GERMAN</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
